		<Placemark id="3A2FF5A9BE3C585FF2EB">
			<name>B03</name>
			<snippet></snippet>
			<description><![CDATA[<div>Sensor ~100ft from Eagle 4 tower on dune. Seismic (nanometrics) #2663. Infrasound #417.&nbsp;<br></div>]]></description>
